\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Scalability validation of the \texttt  {StatefulAutoscaler}: Experiment~C restorm simulation at 800, 1{,}600, and 3{,}200 concurrent clients. ``Expected replicas'' is $\lceil N / T \rceil $; ``Peak replicas'' is the maximum observed during CYCLE~1. ``Safe'' indicates whether all replicas were held through the 90-second DROP~1 gap (1~$=$~yes, 0~$=$~no). The achieved connection count at 3{,}200 clients documents the Kind OS-level TCP ceiling.}}{12}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:scalability}{{4}{12}{}{}{}}
